/-!
# Pointwise fibre reduction for restored-gamma K1.4

This leaf reduces the source-facing K1.4 event inclusion to the three literal
facts that the production trace must establish at the selected restored
gamma child:

* the routed duplex tape successfully decodes;
* the authenticated width-29 word is the word fixed by the non-gamma
  residual; and
* the child's decoded gamma is the value of that routed tape.

The counterfactual response provider, exact sample round-trip, retained
failure witness, and width-29 target membership are constructed here.  Thus
none of those objects remains a source premise.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 1000000
set_option maxHeartbeats 5000000
set_option linter.constructorNameAsVariable false

